# Plugin: Writing Skills

Purpose:
  Adapt writing-skills skill for SDDRA skill creation.

Adaptation:
  SDDRA skill format:
    .sdd/skills/{category}/{technology}/{L1-L5}.sdd

  Skill structure:
    Purpose, Owns, ReadOrder, Rules, State

  Creation guidelines:
    - One skill per file
    - Maximum 200 lines
    - Short IDs where possible
    - Index references, not full paths
    - Rules as numbered list

Usage:
  Chain: skill creation
  Trigger: New technology added, new pattern discovered, skill gap identified

State: +